                        segment->header.seq_num + segment->header.ack_num +
                        segment->flags + segment->window_size +
                        segment->segment_size;
    return (unsigned short)(sum & 0xFFFF);
}

// Function to manage dynamic array of TCP segments
void manage_tcp_segments(size_t max_size, size_t current_load_percentage) {
